{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "3aa0f0484fa0ebdab446b69ee70d33b9ddbf026744c9b3d91f6d1bef96a47818", "ja": "星と月へ", "zh": "前往星与月的方向", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "979f8ea684cfd05dabe1713da78262728b7a7ccac32de6c8687fda48acb1688a", "ja": "第三幕。クライマックスとなる重要なシーン\nを演じる恵美と千鶴、莉緒。エピローグでは\n朋花と恵美、千鶴と伊織がそれぞれ旅立つ。\n本番さながらのリハーサルだった、と\n本番への手応えを感じるプロデューサー。", "zh": "第三幕，惠美、千鹤、莉绪三人\n要演出故事中最高潮的重要场景。\n于尾声，朋花和惠美、千鹤和伊织各自踏上旅程。\n制作人觉得这是一次可媲美正式演出的排练，\n感觉对正式演出很有信心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "91057acce29f3194c914493ac281585842bc96737d61adb4ab6a553a83aedd61", "ja": "みんな、今日は第三幕の稽古だ。\n本番まであと少し、集中して進めよう！", "zh": "各位，今天要排练第三幕。\n就快要到正式演出了，集中精神跟上进度吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "0c79708114307675b58132c971ae6526c7de0644352eaac31b0991efa887dc59", "ja": "どうして、オレ達を殺そうとするんだ！？\nオレもコイツも、悪いことなんてしてないのに！", "zh": "为什么你要杀我们！？\n我们两个明明什么坏事都没做啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "0904abe2b6b1d32fdb7873ca49febc9887935caae413ce77078d6bd7904433f5", "ja": "……貴様らが、ヴァンパイアだからだ。\n私が剣を振るう理由は、それだけでいい。", "zh": "……因为你们是吸血鬼。\n光是这点，就足以构成我挥下这把剑的理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "dd7abbcbfa9fab777129758dc1e68a3aed761a4df0ffd951d8d8a214c386c9f8", "ja": "なんだよ、それ……\nどうしてアンタ、そんなひどい事が言えるんだよ！？", "zh": "这算什么理由……\n为什么你可以说出这么残酷的话！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "85341fbdaef6c57f3520a15f33535410f8ec7b94d6749c9c33ab7a4f0cc8ae56", "ja": "オレ達は生きたい！\n……ヴァンパイアだって、幸せになっていいはずだ！", "zh": "我们想活下来！\n……就算是吸血鬼，应该也有获得幸福的资格才对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "d78508bb25b0fd774872a05026dd38e41d14617fc04e16f5724157e8d45a90b2", "ja": "ヴァンパイアが……幸せに……？", "zh": "吸血鬼……获得幸福……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "dfb1a01ad79be507de0f217d73cd82cb28d8d243eaf0fc3189fda15650c89f3e", "ja": "幸せに……ノエル。……ああ……。", "zh": "获得幸福……诺艾儿……啊啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "998bf448de87009097273c0534002ecf838a83cd9f8886831e1500b024c89e12", "ja": "それに、オレもクリスも、人を襲ったりしない！\nそれでも、オレ達を殺そうっていうのなら……！", "zh": "而且，我跟克利丝都不会攻击人类！\n如果这样你还是要杀我们……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "681d630e75dadea72325c4d4c0133f21c0436d09071b25fbbb54047e29dc63f1", "ja": "エドガー……。", "zh": "艾德嘉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "14ac51e48801530166f41926d229c9b3284a18f241a9db885372879448d10272", "ja": "……人を襲わないという言葉に、\n嘘偽りはあるまいな？", "zh": "……你们不会攻击人类，\n此话可当真？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "6e2fc0c21799287ba5da67d0baa326fe03ce9f36d5de4db374cb77c88ad97ad6", "ja": "ええ、神に誓って。\n……あなた方の神ではなく、ヴァンパイアの神ですが。", "zh": "是的，我向神发誓。\n……但不是向你们的神，而是向吸血鬼的神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "d20bb7de93ef9a6a057ebe87f9af0ba55eab3e77d5fe361090d723587e7970a0", "ja": "……どこへなりとも行くがいい。\nただし、ゆめゆめ忘れるな。", "zh": "……随便你们要到哪里去吧。\n只是，你们千万不要忘记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "36a64e26799c8f102d3051174d32df67701335b8eab4c0b3001659af4b6e914f", "ja": "もし貴様らが人を殺めれば、私が……\nお前達を地の果てまでも追いかけて、殺す。", "zh": "如果你们杀了人，我……\n即使追到世界的尽头也会杀了你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "f63ff5a0d23b4cd0ff4a168e08351bea5cf49f4b4c748e9235a02841ae8a5717", "ja": "……ああ。わかった。", "zh": "……嗯，我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "90b086571fd77c1a7847f9120ff9be56ec84d185cb5be14e8acd252c633c0d6a", "ja": "感謝します、アレクサンドラ。\nお礼に、あることをお教えしましょう。", "zh": "谢谢你，亚历山大。\n为了感谢你，我就告诉你一件事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "e9e01e22c53990ee2d4899a2cc06ea240205c9372b8c0b96ace0f2a692e42ee6", "ja": "……なんだ。", "zh": "……什么事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "e9d7d0674f9199214327c3c041b6d260733f5fc9e4068e23299576bb96f2c236", "ja": "辺境伯夫人、エレオノーラについてです。", "zh": "是关于藩侯夫人，艾蕾欧诺拉的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "84181449450cc1b613fc09ac225d1428f6c8772b4a2191f748779e4623803063", "ja": "怒涛の展開だったな。\n手に汗握る、とはこの事だ……。", "zh": "真是高潮迭起的发展。\n紧张到流手汗就是形容这种情况吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "1efa8bba9e2352a942daea33fcac6465d7cbc3129c48dad62acc9e1aaf64a2b4", "ja": "ううっ……エドガーとクリスが助かって良かった～！\n見逃してくれてありがと～、アレクサンドラ～！", "zh": "呜呜……艾德嘉跟克利丝都保住性命，真是太好了～！\n谢谢你放了他们～亚历山大～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "42f30e9f86bbf332cccfe05cc789f931b32d4443e14420f5bc387f8f0a53618a", "ja": "どういたしまして……と、\nわたくしが言うのはおかしいですわね？　ふふっ。", "zh": "不客气……\n呃，由本小姐来说好像哪里怪怪的？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "1b0c68935c618437a230cefe1fbe2841322225c90c5b02083cc1a6536637d75b", "ja": "次は、いよいよクライマックスですわ。\nこの物語が、どういう結末を迎えるのか……。", "zh": "接下来就要进入故事高潮了。\n这个故事究竟会有什么样的结局呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "b0b768a665d1339000796fbe0dc17ade03c96c9bfcc5a81937e304c06e22b97b", "ja": "その目に焼き付けてくださいまし、\n{$P$}！", "zh": "请你睁大眼睛看清楚了，\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "ede8cf20d5698609c80cf26f3aba830a3c00f23cec652d7fb49c0bc4fd1dce2b", "ja": "あら……珍しいこともあるものね、アレクサンドラ。\n貴女が自ら、この城を訪ねてくるなんて。", "zh": "咦……这可真是稀奇，亚历山大。\n你竟然会主动造访这座城堡。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "50bfb7ad91afbfe412d4058a8cba0c645367d07f4d2033ac0fc4da3e67a56169", "ja": "……自分の愚かしさを恨む。\n貴様の正体に、ここまで気付かなかった事をな……！", "zh": "……我憎恨自己的愚昧。\n竟然一直以来都没有发现你的真面目……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "ce8ada9a1147ece6c9dba6f0c97efde24eb5dd3f5dabe3f8e4267fb3a4772c6c", "ja": "エレオノーラ！　いや、ヴァンパイア……！\nよくも私を騙してくれたな！？", "zh": "艾蕾欧诺拉！不对，吸血鬼……！\n你竟然骗了我！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1025_046rio", "source_sha256": "509cb7cfb619a7effacfad75120fd680a286ed5285d6894ca7912356017d3bea", "ja": "あら……人間ごときが、私の正体を見破るなんて。\nどうしてわかったの？　褒めてあげるわ、ウフフ。", "zh": "哦……区区人类居然可以看穿我的真面目。\n你是怎么知道的？我该夸奖你一下，呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1026_038chz", "source_sha256": "356617ef1e4175900bb6bc7c6b913af9890e73e99643a942dd54d8a911255692", "ja": "ひとつだけ聞かせろ。何故ヴァンパイアの貴様が、\n私にヴァンパイア狩りを命じた？", "zh": "我只问你一件事。\n为什么你身为吸血鬼，却命令我去狩猎吸血鬼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1027_046rio", "source_sha256": "38b1e14cf2d9219e6f32faa68aee23132459ff8817762467f9bdc73382bc9192", "ja": "もちろん、淘汰のためよ？\nたとえ同族でも、私の王国に弱き血族は不要だわ。", "zh": "当然是为了淘汰啰！\n即使身为同族，我的王国里也不需要弱者。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1028_046rio", "source_sha256": "3a296368a896dd932e55190cc4e529580c46d32c77046d33663d82c413067459", "ja": "私がこれから作る王国には、ノエルのような、\n強大な力を持つヴァンパイアさえいればいいの。", "zh": "我接下来要建立的王国，只需要有像诺艾儿这样，\n拥有强大力量的吸血鬼就够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1029_046rio", "source_sha256": "08611d4dc5b9b0a6c90b70ec1fe6dd429d2962004e1c882cca728825830cf2e6", "ja": "嗚呼、ノエル……あの力は、まるで私の愛し子……。\nあの子を同族に迎え入れた時の、血の歓喜と来たら！", "zh": "啊，诺艾儿……那份力量，完全就是我最爱的孩子……\n一想起让那孩子成为我的族人时，血液中流动的喜悦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1030_038chz", "source_sha256": "12895f879bc46ee53d9502f5d430feeccf65e1ddbd60c504cd8b17368fa333f0", "ja": "なっ……貴様が、ノエルをヴァンパイアに！？\nではあの晩屋敷を襲い、我が父と母を殺したのも……！", "zh": "什……是你把诺艾儿变成吸血鬼的！？\n也就是说那天晚上攻击宅邸，杀了我父母的也是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1031_046rio", "source_sha256": "dcd857573f9cc30be83455c1d8edf9a9ca9eafd3d0fbd3ee5d0913d1bf4a37c8", "ja": "ええ、そう……私よ？\n今でもあの時の高揚を、覚えているわ……フフッ！", "zh": "是的，没错……就是我。\n直到现在我都还记得那时候亢奋的感觉……呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1032_038chz", "source_sha256": "a7d16713726d67a4d31bd7b98ca5bb1f9fb3d61565c62aaac61ce15fbab7ee0c", "ja": "……許さん……許さんぞ、エレオノーラ！\nその悪逆……我が剣の露となり、散るがいい！", "zh": "……不能原谅……我不会原谅你的，艾蕾欧诺拉！\n我要让你的罪孽……化为剑刃上的血珠，让你命丧于此！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1033_046rio", "source_sha256": "3171ceef6fe8a9415a7bdd70632e1b2868f2e45277d5cb8e6825ef4846ca4206", "ja": "貴女に私は殺せないわ、アレクサンドラ。忘れて？　\n私の香がなければ、ノエルは目覚めるのよ。", "zh": "你是杀不了我的，亚历山大。\n你忘了吗？如果没有我的香，诺艾儿就会醒过来喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1034_046rio", "source_sha256": "fb8a87720ece0319d4512b5b4fdcca97e3c19431ca4588b8cd74bb25e71a874c", "ja": "でも、それも一興かもね？　目覚めたあの子が、\n人の血をすする様を見てみたいわぁ……フフフフフッ！", "zh": "不过，这样或许也不错。我真想看看那孩子醒来之后，\n吸取人血的模样……呵呵呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1035_038chz", "source_sha256": "19f13ba5627e6fc6aa9f4ba9ff445c83aa35c71cec0b189679b4839b830d8607", "ja": "くっ……貴様！", "zh": "呜……你这家伙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1036_046rio", "source_sha256": "83cb3c9e5e7cdfe854b03cfae5edd7f16c25975cdd32642af73e7dfb7cc15048", "ja": "やだ、そんな怖い顔をしないでちょうだい？\n心配いらないわ、貴女も私達の血族にしてあげる……。", "zh": "讨厌，表情不要那么恐怖嘛。\n不用担心，我也会让你成为我们的血族……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1037_046rio", "source_sha256": "b4402a4783dfeae47270dd647e5bc88c20cc4354fe1c940cfe8279b8f3bad2ce", "ja": "そうすれば、姉妹仲良く暮らせるわ。\n私たちヴァンパイアの……血と闇の世界でね。", "zh": "这样一来，你们姊妹就可以相亲相爱的生活在一起了。\n在我们吸血鬼的……鲜血与黑暗的世界里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1038_038chz", "source_sha256": "26043428b8f10ebd7e73e38d2fe774498ea9ec75ca525b0db6c7bbb5216cc3b4", "ja": "そのような誘惑に、誰が乗るものか！\n滅びるがいい、ヴァンパイア！", "zh": "我才不会因为那种诱惑上钩呢！\n毁灭吧，吸血鬼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1039_se", "source_sha256": "a58e4cbc0366c3cd1219d4b4042375e3c9724efd7957a3779dcd6165c1436f1c", "ja": "ザシュッ！", "zh": "咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1040_046rio", "source_sha256": "515b8bc16ca1fc1de8dbb7cce28125c2605b63d36901b586e1d368bfe71271df", "ja": "かふっ……。なんて、愚かな、子……。\n永遠の時を……我が悠久を、拒むなんて……。", "zh": "呜呃……多么……愚蠢……的人……\n居然拒绝接受……永远的时间……我们恒久的生命……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1041_046rio", "source_sha256": "e18be3b5f5968e938539e343af50301ce630280f26a59beae67c7f9892f1d61c", "ja": "フフ……後悔するわよ、アレクサンドラ……。\nせいぜい、あがきなさい。この、苦しみの世界で……。", "zh": "呵呵……你会后悔的，亚历山大……\n你就在这充满苦难的世界上，尽可能的挣扎吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1042_038chz", "source_sha256": "3c7b62109d6af72d93b0d012adb5207ad76f7328ac1a3258fe8d0618c0f7d234", "ja": "私は、我が妹を……ノエルを信じる。\n人間を……人間の心を持つ者たちを、信じる。", "zh": "我相信我的妹妹……诺艾儿。\n我相信人类……相信拥有人类心灵的存在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1043_038chz", "source_sha256": "55fd5e3a6f2e2df3a95f881c6e0cfc943e417a7d764781de7f35bf181b650405", "ja": "だから、もし、ノエルが人を殺せば……。\n……私が、この手で……人として……。", "zh": "所以，如果诺艾儿杀了人……\n……我就会亲手……代表人类……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1044_p", "source_sha256": "e3ca0a8b8b7d2e00f4356003e5b8ba8ea7499cf212ebce739f83a8621e5698bf", "ja": "お疲れさま、莉緒。\n辺境伯夫人エレオノーラの最期、よかったぞ。", "zh": "辛苦了，莉绪。\n藩侯夫人艾蕾欧诺拉的临终场景演得很好喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1045_046rio", "source_sha256": "79af1e4c9c7297126156c0272e759775ef959bd7bf245722313856172978db08", "ja": "ウフフ、ありがとっ。……さて、私はここで退場かぁ。\n悪いヴァンパイアとはいえ、悲しい役だったわね。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢……那么，我的戏份就到这里了呢。\n虽然她是邪恶的吸血鬼，却是个悲伤的角色呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1046_046rio", "source_sha256": "17bd6a230d5d8aa363fa2a4463713297633a39b65a14ee1e8975868d226a8a0b", "ja": "けど、悪女を演じるのって楽しかったわ♪\n本番では、もっと楽しんで演じるつもりよ！", "zh": "不过，演坏女人真的好开心喔♪\n正式演出的时候我会更乐在其中的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1047_046rio", "source_sha256": "ba312ea8151c8d50f24f2dec9f0b7ed4903c9daf25439cf6797c5f88123ad81f", "ja": "それにしても千鶴ちゃん、\nスゴい迫力だったわ……。", "zh": "话说回来，\n千鹤好有魄力喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1048_p", "source_sha256": "a7f50135ee6f194d8048d0b8596ecc27854bb7ce3a9bc5944aeebf075d7de98c", "ja": "ああ。\n千鶴さんも、アレクサンドラをつかんだみたいだ……。", "zh": "嗯，看来千鹤也掌握到如何诠释亚历山大了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1049_038chz", "source_sha256": "c91237568f1171cbb0744353b80c1c3a25dc60fe39013d5d2500377ad0ad1b20", "ja": "……ノエル。起きて、くれノエル。\n愛しい我が妹よ……。", "zh": "……诺艾儿。快醒醒，诺艾儿。\n我亲爱的妹妹啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1050_007ior", "source_sha256": "56a5eda1e3a9fba17230cccd404d22aca4d145ad2a8c18e604d60d31fa51c4b2", "ja": "……お姉さま。ああ、お姉さま……！\n私、なんだか悪い夢を見ていたようなの……。", "zh": "……姊姊。啊，姊姊……！\n我感觉好像做了一场恶梦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1051_038chz", "source_sha256": "ef284cf4ba12e0f1957cbf1d38311f8b5a27250087c9388ebb127473574a3176", "ja": "大丈夫だ。ノエル、私がついている。\nこれまでも……これからも。ずっと……。", "zh": "没事了。诺艾儿，有我陪着你。\n无论是以前……还是未来，永远都会在你身边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1052_007ior", "source_sha256": "c7df0df0a7b8d059c622197be6ee49b809f0cb7c022c561b7e2139b20267a245", "ja": "お姉さま……？", "zh": "姊姊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1053_038chz", "source_sha256": "5eaf7274f153c06096913c4a416fec792557df2e9ee3901ade03ddd9cac3905b", "ja": "お前にもしもの事があった時は、必ず、私が……。\nだから、共に行こう……。", "zh": "如果你有什么万一，届时我必定会……\n所以，我们一起走吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1054_031tom", "source_sha256": "34c72f66a3c897cd0f45b33bcb40167247359ca416c779790822963e0502381c", "ja": "あれから私達は、\n『約束の地』を探して旅をしている。", "zh": "在那之后，\n我们踏上了寻找『约定之地』的旅程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1055_031tom", "source_sha256": "58bf3544e4438515ee71f7da178dabdcae87daba5989c33b36fa9a4fec272265", "ja": "エドガーの言う『約束の地』が本当にあるのかなんて、\nわからない。けれど、ひとつだけ確かなことがある。", "zh": "虽然我不清楚艾德嘉说的『约定之地』是否真的存在。\n但唯有一件事我很肯定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1056_031tom", "source_sha256": "5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4", "ja": "それは……。", "zh": "那就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1057_031tom", "source_sha256": "a39d8f6b137a079e146b70096ddf53ea9205cc4022d3216d3c7d9352b6582f5e", "ja": "……エドガー。\nアナタといるだけで、私は幸せです。", "zh": "……艾德嘉。\n只要跟你在一起，我就很幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1058_020meg", "source_sha256": "1af1acbb65d10955d294e710fc70e6ffa3545e6bd2b34570bbff4012177aad2f", "ja": "ああ。オレもだよ、クリス。\n……にゃはは！　なんか照れるな、こういうのって！", "zh": "嗯，我也是，克利丝。\n……呀哈哈！这样子感觉还真有点不好意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1059_020meg", "source_sha256": "3dd95568e0fe30f46388d5bb002f7d096f2b38f9c7e1344f2a88a2a931b50711", "ja": "あっ……お、オレ、なんか顔熱くなってきちゃった！\n顔洗ってくるな！", "zh": "啊……我、我的脸好像有点热热的！\n我去洗把脸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1060_031tom", "source_sha256": "b6520a9091b1af6cb7934f6e2f01663fba981bc834f0051a4aaca0cb60f258a2", "ja": "ありがとうエドガー、私を孤独から救ってくれて……\nこの暗闇に光を射してくれたのは、貴方……。", "zh": "艾德嘉，谢谢你从孤独中拯救了我……\n是你在这片黑暗中射进了一道光芒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1061_031tom", "source_sha256": "0beb174a0efe62001e8d9a796b92fd65f19f62d83c772f76fad5a2ca723f9f77", "ja": "貴方と共にいられることが、きっと……\n私の『約束の地』なのですね……。", "zh": "可以和你生涯与共，一定……\n就是我的『约定之地』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1062_p", "source_sha256": "77d8231cb4ff3cc4db5c50b4de3aed67a15fcb8d4cb2154b1f6f0260219112a8", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\n本番さながらの素晴らしい仕上がりだったな。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n完成度很高，简直可以媲美正式演出了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1063_038chz", "source_sha256": "8f7a5052e775c45aa8e1933ed1dc1570f050f71646be0559fdee727724048280", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nけれど、これで慢心したりしませんわ！", "zh": "谢谢你。\n不过本小姐可不会因此懈怠！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1064_031tom", "source_sha256": "aded29a71748a7525a15ef5490548e48f13e4bf4bd4bf2934f72503987bf2f7e", "ja": "ええ。本番までに、より完成度を高めて、\n歴史に残る素晴らしい劇にしましょう～♪", "zh": "嗯，在正式演出之前更加提升完成度，\n让这出舞台剧成为一部名留青史的优秀杰作吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1065_020meg", "source_sha256": "cd35bd7da1b4959b3ea088189bb4728a4afe614ed1b1ca5a842396d9bb8a8117", "ja": "アタシ達みんなで力合わせて、頑張ろうね！\n本番が楽しみだな～。", "zh": "我们大家一起齐心协力加油吧！\n我好期待正式演出喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0020_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0020_story_06_1066_046rio", "source_sha256": "a07142a06900b4653fdca18f9dd5b6239b67c5b5542ef89a50d0cd633f640904", "ja": "みんなこんなに頑張ってるんだもの。\nきっと本番も大成功、間違いなしよ♪", "zh": "大家都这么努力了，\n正式演出一定也会非常成功的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
